      "name": "vidcap_set_style",
      "description": "Style the captions. template = id from vidcap_templates. patch = any CaptionStyle fields to override (fontFamily, fontWeight, fontSize as fraction of height, fill, highlightColor, uppercase, stroke{color,width}, shadow, background{color,padding,radius,blur}, activeBackground, reveal line|word|karaoke|wipe, enter, pop, activeScale, maxWordsPerLine, emoji, motion). Unknown fields are reported in \"ignored\". box = {x,y,width} normalised 0..1 (centre of the caption block; y 0.78 is the usual lower third, keep above ~0.85 on 9:16 to clear platform UI). aspect = Original|9:16|16:9|1:1|4:5. Pass line=<lineId> to style one line only (clear:true removes its override).",
